  "description": "YITAMOTOR floor mats are made with high-density TPE material, using advanced 3D laser technology, which not only provides a superb feel and extreme wear resistance but also offers a precise fit to your vehicle floor.\nFitment\n2018-2024 Chevrolet Equinox/GMC Terrain\nFeatures\nCustom Fit: These floor mats trunk mats& backrest mat fit for 2018 2019 2020 2021 2022 2023 2024 Chevrolet Equinox/GMC Terrain; 3D laser scanning technology provides full protection for the first and second rows, trunk, and seat backs\nEco-Safe Certification: Our 2024 Chevy Equinox floor mats with Backrest are recyclable and durable, approved by GRS, SGS, and IATF; Eco-safe material withstands the rigor of daily abuse, offering great performance in both arctic cold and tropical heat\nAll-Season Protection & Non-Slip: With unique channels and raised edges, 2023 Chevrolet Equinox floor liners effectively trap liquids, snow, and sand to keep your car and shoes clean; The hooks provide anti-slip stability even in wet conditions\nEasy To Clean: The floor mats GMC Terrain feature a textured, skid-resistant surface that is easy to clean; Neither cumbersome vacuum cleaners nor harsh chemicals are needed; Simply shake them out or spray them down with a hose\nWhy Choose YITAMOTOR: Our floor mats are crafted with advanced technology, rendering tailored protection and all-weather guard for your vehicle; The safe material is suitable for people of all ages",
  "highlights": [
    "They securely attach to your vehicle using the original factory clasps, keeping the floor liners firmly in place and preventing unwanted shifting during daily driving.",
    "The raised edges provide maximum vehicle coverage, Floor Liners accurately and completely line the vehicle carpet giving absolute interior protection.",
    "Specially designed channels ensure the liner effectively contain the liquid to keep your vehicle and shoes clean, non-slip design for safe driving."
  ],
